Z||000000||FieroMaster88||11-05-2001||02:45 AM||||I was looking for some stuff to dress up my engine compartment today and realized some colored vacuum line would look AWESOME.  Replace the cruddy black factory line with some bright red or yellow hose from <A HREF="http://www.hosetechniques.com." TARGET=_blank>www.hosetechniques.com.</A>   I go to their site and start looking.  I notice they make custom kits for certain cars, so I click to see what cars they make them for.  I see a bunch of rice cars, but nothing for the Fiero.  They even make a kit for the MR2!  Well, I decided to e-mail them and see if they were going to make a kit for our beloved Fiero's.  I get this reply:<P>"James......If you know of a "showroom stock-clean engine" Fiero in the<BR>LA area, please advise me.  I will make that kit."<P>Well, does anyone want to help me out here?  I believe the person who came up with the idea and the person to supply the car for measurements get a free kit when they are done!  It would be awesome for someone to make something for our cars!  What do you think?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">                  <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!||||reg||1
